        "en": "Many clients commend Dr Corey Greenfield, Dr Sheila Ditsche, and their veterinary technicians for comprehensive explanations and thoughtful patient care. Reviewers emphasize that the staff listens carefully and avoids pushing unnecessary diagnostic tests. Longtime clients trust the team with dogs, cats, and birds across many years of visits."
