        "en": "Gentle handling for dogs and birds"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners appreciate the calm handling of challenging patients, including anxious parrots and nervous puppies. Multiple reviewers mention that pets walk in comfortably and receive patient attention during dental cleanings, claw trims, and vaccinations. Clients value having avian veterinary expertise available within the same practice."
      }
    },
